      "title": "Figma adds code layers, specs, and agent workflows to canvas",
      "summary": "Figma launched updates uniting design, code, and context on its canvas. Code layers entered open beta for prototypes backed by real code, alongside Specs context containers and integrations for human teams and AI agents.",
